WEBVTT

00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:40.016
Shorty's missing?

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:42.060
He's still not back?

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:42.936
He's gone soft!

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:46.856
That punk. This goes beyond super lame.

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:48.858
What is he doing?

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:51.528
That's not good.

00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:54.781
Our captain has a short fuse.

00:01:56.032 --> 00:01:57.701
I'm sick of waiting.

00:01:58.743 --> 00:02:01.079
Let's go, Tokugawa.

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:15.468
"Resolve"

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:35.030
Now I'm convinced.

00:02:35.905 --> 00:02:38.783
I've become too strong.

00:02:40.076 --> 00:02:42.954
You think you can cross
the ocean in a rowboat?

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:52.297
Tremble in fear of sinking as you row.

00:02:53.506 --> 00:02:55.759
My conviction can't be shaken.

00:02:56.926 --> 00:02:59.429
A real match?

00:02:59.429 --> 00:03:00.805
What's wrong?

00:03:00.805 --> 00:03:03.391
Did you remember something
about your brother?

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.519
Are you really my brother?

00:03:07.854 --> 00:03:12.817
Well, it was when you were way
shorter than you are now...

00:03:16.321 --> 00:03:17.572
Listen, Ryoga.

00:03:18.281 --> 00:03:20.992
Starting today, I'm your dad,

00:03:21.368 --> 00:03:22.994
and this kid's your brother.

00:03:23.495 --> 00:03:24.412
His name's Ryoma.

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:27.082
Nice to meet you, Shorty.

00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:30.210
Don't be shy.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:33.338
We're going to be living under the same roof.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:35.507
Um...

00:03:37.967 --> 00:03:39.886
I know. Play tennis.

00:03:40.845 --> 00:03:42.931
No need to talk while you play tennis.

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:49.312
Let's have a real match!

00:03:49.312 --> 00:03:50.605
No way!

00:03:53.316 --> 00:03:55.026
Once you get better.

00:03:56.528 --> 00:03:58.697
Try me, then.

00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:01.408
You little upstart!

00:04:01.408 --> 00:04:03.326
You're hurting me, Brother!

00:04:03.993 --> 00:04:05.870
Does that hurt? In that case...

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:08.540
That tickles!

00:04:09.499 --> 00:04:11.960
Let's have a real match, Brother!

00:04:12.293 --> 00:04:13.837
No way.

00:04:40.238 --> 00:04:41.281
Moving?

00:04:41.573 --> 00:04:45.577
You'll be moving in with your aunt.

00:04:46.786 --> 00:04:48.997
She insisted.

00:04:50.874 --> 00:04:54.586
Am I not going to be
Shorty's brother anymore?

00:04:56.087 --> 00:04:57.630
Even if you're apart,

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:00.717
you'll still be Ryoma's brother.

00:05:04.721 --> 00:05:06.264
Brother!

00:05:06.264 --> 00:05:08.391
Brother! Where are you going?

00:05:08.933 --> 00:05:10.477
Brother, don't go!

00:05:11.061 --> 00:05:13.480
It's been fun, Shorty.

00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:19.277
Brother!

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:21.780
Brother!

00:05:22.113 --> 00:05:23.198
"Keep playing tennis.
If we keep getting stronger,
we'll meet again someday."

00:05:23.198 --> 00:05:24.491
"Keep playing tennis.
If we keep getting stronger,
we'll meet again someday."
Brother!

00:05:24.491 --> 00:05:26.242
"we'll meet again someday"

00:05:26.242 --> 00:05:27.911
"we'll meet again someday"
Hey, Ryoga.

00:05:27.911 --> 00:05:29.454
"we'll meet again someday"
It's been a while.

00:05:31.206 --> 00:05:33.500
Ryoma didn't remember you?

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.376
Oh, yeah.

00:05:34.376 --> 00:05:38.296
He lost his memory at one
point during the nationals.

00:05:39.631 --> 00:05:41.591
He's probably still feeling the effects.

00:05:42.384 --> 00:05:45.178
Play tennis with him like you used to.

00:05:48.223 --> 00:05:50.058
What's wrong, Shorty?

00:05:50.475 --> 00:05:53.478
You want a real match or not?

00:05:57.315 --> 00:06:00.068
Let's have a real match.

00:06:02.487 --> 00:06:03.697
Game, Tokugawa!

00:06:03.697 --> 00:06:05.115
Three games all!

00:06:09.953 --> 00:06:15.500
There's no doubt. This match is
entering unprecedented territory...

00:06:16.459 --> 00:06:17.919
Tokugawa...

00:06:17.919 --> 00:06:21.631
Go fulfill your promise from a year ago.

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:31.808
That kid who joined today is amazing.

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:33.893
Tokugawa-<i>kun</i>, right?

00:06:35.186 --> 00:06:36.980
Isn't he a first year?

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:39.649
No one stands a chance against him.

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:45.530
Is there no one worth playing at this camp?

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.574
Okay, then, play me.

00:06:52.162 --> 00:06:53.747
Byodoin...

00:06:53.997 --> 00:06:57.042
Fine, but put your shoes on properly.

00:06:57.042 --> 00:06:59.794
You look like you just woke up,
so you should warm u--

00:06:59.794 --> 00:07:01.671
What are you, my mother-in-law?

00:07:01.671 --> 00:07:02.922
I'm fine.

00:07:03.715 --> 00:07:08.345
It's invigorating to get to play against
an elite athlete returning from abroad.

00:07:16.561 --> 00:07:17.896
He's unconscious!

00:07:17.896 --> 00:07:18.980
He can't play!

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.652
What's wrong, elite?

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:26.529
Aren't you going to go pro?

00:07:27.197 --> 00:07:28.365
In that case...

00:07:29.657 --> 00:07:33.745
I'll teach you the true meaning
of winning and losing!

00:07:36.664 --> 00:07:38.416
Let him forfeit.

00:07:39.167 --> 00:07:39.834
No.

00:07:40.085 --> 00:07:42.754
This man has a promising future!

00:07:42.754 --> 00:07:44.005
Quiet!

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:48.343
Shut up and get out of the way!

00:07:56.226 --> 00:07:57.602
You...

00:07:57.602 --> 00:08:00.397
I'll take over this match.

00:08:01.022 --> 00:08:02.649
I won't let you hurt him.

00:08:03.316 --> 00:08:04.818
"Medical Office"

00:08:04.818 --> 00:08:07.237
"Medical Office"
That should do it.

00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:09.948
Huh? His pulse...

00:08:10.865 --> 00:08:11.950
No...

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:12.992
Tokugawa-<i>kun</i>!

00:08:15.203 --> 00:08:17.038
This can't be!

00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:23.753
Just kidding.

00:08:24.838 --> 00:08:27.257
Your little joke flopped, Irie.

00:08:28.299 --> 00:08:31.261
Huh? You don't like that kind
of humor, Tokugawa-<i>kun</i>?

00:08:33.555 --> 00:08:36.683
Losing makes people grow.

00:08:37.976 --> 00:08:42.105
Yes. It's a vital part of growing stronger.

00:08:42.647 --> 00:08:46.026
So... stop crying.

00:08:46.943 --> 00:08:49.112
Men are only allowed to cry

00:08:49.112 --> 00:08:51.489
when they've achieved their greatest desire.

00:08:54.034 --> 00:08:56.244
You're not going abroad?

00:08:56.828 --> 00:08:58.371
Why not?

00:08:58.788 --> 00:09:00.915
There's someone we want to train.

00:09:01.374 --> 00:09:03.626
What did Byodoin-<i>kun </i>say?

00:09:03.626 --> 00:09:05.754
Isn't he your top player?

00:09:05.754 --> 00:09:07.339
You asked him, didn't you?

00:09:08.048 --> 00:09:09.883
Someone will take his place.

00:09:09.883 --> 00:09:12.218
Just like someone took mine.

00:09:14.304 --> 00:09:17.265
He will be next.

00:09:23.438 --> 00:09:26.900
I lack the insatiable drive to win.

00:09:27.484 --> 00:09:30.779
I will face you with the
intention of beating you.

00:09:35.075 --> 00:09:37.327
Step deeper!

00:09:39.329 --> 00:09:41.790
Your reactions are slowing!

00:09:48.672 --> 00:09:50.590
Irie-<i>san</i>, Oni-<i>san</i>...

00:09:51.299 --> 00:09:56.346
Don't. If you thank us, Oni-<i>san </i>will
be so embarrassed, he'll cry.

00:09:59.933 --> 00:10:03.019
Then allow me to make a promise.

00:10:04.396 --> 00:10:05.522
A promise?

00:10:16.574 --> 00:10:19.703
I will become the best player
on the Japanese team!

00:10:22.288 --> 00:10:25.458
He's putting up a good fight
against the first string's best.

00:10:26.001 --> 00:10:27.377
Not bad.

00:10:29.921 --> 00:10:32.716
What the heck did Tokugawa do?

00:10:35.468 --> 00:10:37.220
Have you...

00:10:41.558 --> 00:10:42.767
Game, Tokugawa!

00:10:42.767 --> 00:10:44.352
Four games to three!

00:10:46.104 --> 00:10:50.275
You've entered the Divine Path of the Asura...

00:10:51.651 --> 00:10:55.947
I will put my life on the line for this match!

00:11:03.955 --> 00:11:05.373
Amazing...

00:11:05.373 --> 00:11:06.374
This is...

00:11:07.208 --> 00:11:10.045
...a match between top U-17 players...

00:11:11.171 --> 00:11:13.340
He really is like an Asura!

00:11:14.215 --> 00:11:15.675
Six games all!

00:11:15.675 --> 00:11:17.761
First set tiebreaker!

00:11:18.219 --> 00:11:20.930
They brought it to a tiebreaker.

00:11:21.222 --> 00:11:22.974
Oni, he can do it.

00:11:22.974 --> 00:11:23.850
Yeah.

00:11:25.226 --> 00:11:27.896
I've finally caught up to you.

00:11:28.563 --> 00:11:30.357
Kurobe, Tsuge-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:30.357 --> 00:11:32.442
Tokugawa-<i>kun</i>'s equaling him!

00:11:32.817 --> 00:11:36.112
No, perhaps he's exceeded Byodoin-<i>kun</i>!

00:11:36.112 --> 00:11:37.697
Does it remind you of something?

00:11:37.697 --> 00:11:38.323
Huh?

00:11:39.407 --> 00:11:43.828
There was a similar fight
for life, two years ago...

00:11:46.247 --> 00:11:49.250
I don't even know what's
happening anymore!

00:11:50.168 --> 00:11:53.588
You're the first man to push me this far!

00:11:53.588 --> 00:11:56.800
But I know I won't lose!

00:12:00.804 --> 00:12:02.389
I should thank you.

00:12:02.389 --> 00:12:05.141
By risking my life in this battle with you,

00:12:05.141 --> 00:12:08.019
I will gain extra-dimensional strength!

00:12:09.145 --> 00:12:11.564
Jujiroh Oni, farewell!

00:12:23.743 --> 00:12:26.454
I'll drag you down to hell with me,

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.249
Houoh Byodoin!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:31.668
Marvelous.

00:12:32.293 --> 00:12:35.088
But you're already at your limit!

00:12:39.759 --> 00:12:42.429
What... What is that?

00:12:42.721 --> 00:12:44.472
Game and match, Oni!

00:12:44.472 --> 00:12:46.016
Seven games to six!

00:12:47.851 --> 00:12:52.439
Their lives truly were on the line.

00:12:53.857 --> 00:12:55.483
After that loss,

00:12:55.483 --> 00:12:59.404
Byodoin-<i>kun </i>acquired the strength of an Asura.

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:04.826
Can he really be overcome so easily?

00:13:06.536 --> 00:13:08.371
Six-five, Tokugawa!

00:13:09.289 --> 00:13:10.957
History does change.

00:13:10.957 --> 00:13:12.250
That's all.

00:13:13.251 --> 00:13:14.753
I like your spirit,

00:13:15.170 --> 00:13:18.506
but I know I won't lose.

00:13:19.424 --> 00:13:22.093
Just one more point, Tokugawa-<i>kun</i>.

00:13:22.677 --> 00:13:26.264
You have to make your
move now to win this set.

00:13:29.476 --> 00:13:32.270
Come and get me, elite!

00:13:34.856 --> 00:13:35.857
That's...

00:13:36.524 --> 00:13:39.027
Tokugawa chose to hit a glowing shot.

00:13:40.362 --> 00:13:41.780
Tokugawa!

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:46.284
Put everything you've suffered
in the name of revenge into that ball!

00:13:48.745 --> 00:13:49.662
Go!

00:13:50.872 --> 00:13:52.957
I will change history!

00:14:10.475 --> 00:14:13.520
This brings back memories, Oni...

00:14:14.604 --> 00:14:17.524
You're the ones who will be destroyed!

00:14:29.411 --> 00:14:33.832
I-It's out of bounds,
but he broke the wall...

00:14:34.624 --> 00:14:36.251
That destructive power...

00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:40.547
I guess they're not the top players
on Japan's team for nothing.

00:14:40.547 --> 00:14:44.175
G-Game and first set,
second string, Tokugawa!

00:14:44.175 --> 00:14:45.969
Seven games to six!

00:14:46.469 --> 00:14:48.722
The best in Japan?

00:14:49.806 --> 00:14:54.728
That may be your goal, but I
will show you how small you are.

00:14:55.186 --> 00:14:58.356
I will show you the strength of the world.

00:15:00.233 --> 00:15:02.944
Tokugawa-<i>san </i>won the set...

00:15:03.236 --> 00:15:06.322
But Byodoin clearly has the upper hand.

00:15:07.907 --> 00:15:09.909
Are you okay, Tokugawa-<i>kun</i>?

00:15:12.495 --> 00:15:14.330
We may have...

00:15:14.831 --> 00:15:22.297
...released the unbelievable
power within Byodoin.

00:15:24.632 --> 00:15:26.176
I will keep my promise.

00:15:26.676 --> 00:15:28.053
That's all there is to it.

00:15:31.222 --> 00:15:32.307
Second set!

00:15:32.307 --> 00:15:34.017
Byodoin to serve!

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:38.646
Taste my extra-dimensional tennis!

00:16:00.085 --> 00:16:01.503
Game, Byodoin!

00:16:01.503 --> 00:16:03.088
Six games to love!

00:16:06.549 --> 00:16:10.428
Is this your idea of risking your life?

00:16:11.763 --> 00:16:12.597
One all!

00:16:12.597 --> 00:16:13.932
Final set, play!

00:16:16.935 --> 00:16:17.727
Hey!

00:16:18.103 --> 00:16:20.146
He's about to collapse!

00:16:21.981 --> 00:16:23.441
Wake up!

00:16:23.441 --> 00:16:25.568
I won't allow you to lose consciousness!

00:16:27.278 --> 00:16:29.531
Th-This is torture!

00:16:32.909 --> 00:16:34.369
That's pretty brutal.

00:16:34.953 --> 00:16:36.621
Why does he have to go this far?

00:16:37.497 --> 00:16:39.833
After his loss two years ago,

00:16:39.833 --> 00:16:44.295
he became abnormally fixated on victory.

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:48.591
To prevent his opponents
from challenging him again,

00:16:48.591 --> 00:16:51.636
he humiliates them,
shatters their confidence,

00:16:51.636 --> 00:16:53.263
and forces them to submit.

00:16:53.263 --> 00:16:55.223
He plays like a king...

00:16:55.557 --> 00:16:59.144
He beat all kinds of foreigners abroad.

00:16:59.477 --> 00:17:05.567
Many of the guys he beat were left
in such despair, they quit tennis.

00:17:07.986 --> 00:17:13.491
You're the only one who came back
for revenge after losing to me.

00:17:15.076 --> 00:17:16.411
That's not a compliment.

00:17:16.911 --> 00:17:20.165
Because Oni and Irie interfered,

00:17:20.165 --> 00:17:23.835
I couldn't crush your spirit completely then.

00:17:25.462 --> 00:17:28.089
Your resolve was so flimsy,

00:17:28.089 --> 00:17:31.384
yet those fools bet their
futures in tennis on you.

00:17:32.761 --> 00:17:34.679
Their careers died in vain.

00:17:37.515 --> 00:17:38.516
Didn't I...

00:17:39.309 --> 00:17:43.521
Didn't I say I'd risk my life for this game?

00:17:43.855 --> 00:17:45.732
My resolve!

00:18:04.417 --> 00:18:05.919
Black Hole.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:10.256
With this, I will stop all your shots!

00:18:15.762 --> 00:18:17.305
What was that?

00:18:17.305 --> 00:18:20.725
It was like the space in front
of the ball just disappeared.

00:18:22.977 --> 00:18:24.688
Black Hole?

00:18:25.605 --> 00:18:29.693
You tear open a hole in space by
swinging before you hit the ball.

00:18:30.443 --> 00:18:34.114
No matter what kind of
intense shots Byodoin hits,

00:18:34.114 --> 00:18:36.658
the void will stop them.

00:18:37.075 --> 00:18:40.078
But it takes its toll on your body.

00:18:40.412 --> 00:18:44.082
If you use it, it's sure to shorten your career.

00:18:44.582 --> 00:18:46.876
Your time limit is 30 minutes.

00:18:46.876 --> 00:18:49.004
Use it only when victory is near.

00:18:49.921 --> 00:18:52.549
If possible, don't use it at all.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.553
A-Again!

00:18:57.178 --> 00:18:59.973
This is my resolve!

00:19:01.099 --> 00:19:02.642
Game, second string, Tokugawa!

00:19:02.642 --> 00:19:03.893
Three games all!

00:19:05.478 --> 00:19:08.481
You have indeed become too strong.

00:19:08.857 --> 00:19:10.400
You're dangerous.

00:19:12.193 --> 00:19:13.528
I will eliminate you!

00:19:14.529 --> 00:19:16.114
I told you!

00:19:16.114 --> 00:19:17.657
I will stop all your shots!

00:19:20.035 --> 00:19:21.661
Neither one's giving ground!

00:19:22.787 --> 00:19:25.582
They're really chipping away
at each other's life spans.

00:19:26.416 --> 00:19:29.878
Tokugawa, the world is vast.

00:19:32.213 --> 00:19:34.132
Pirates of the World!

00:19:35.508 --> 00:19:37.093
Countless balls!

00:19:37.677 --> 00:19:38.678
But...

00:19:44.184 --> 00:19:45.352
It's futile.

00:19:46.227 --> 00:19:48.188
Th-This kid...

00:19:51.149 --> 00:19:52.734
What's wrong, Shorty?

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:58.281
Hey, Shorty!

00:20:01.493 --> 00:20:05.121
Looks like our "real match" is on hold.

00:20:08.166 --> 00:20:09.584
Tokugawa!

00:20:09.584 --> 00:20:10.669
Tokugawa-<i>kun</i>!

00:20:18.176 --> 00:20:21.179
Is there anyone you'd give
your own life to beat?

00:20:22.847 --> 00:20:23.973
Not yet.

00:20:25.809 --> 00:20:26.768
It's...

00:20:27.727 --> 00:20:29.396
...not over yet.

00:20:29.771 --> 00:20:31.272
What's going on?

00:20:31.606 --> 00:20:35.610
He hasn't reached the 30-minute
time limit for Black Hole yet.

00:20:36.027 --> 00:20:39.823
The damage he suffered last
night decreased his limit.

00:20:40.198 --> 00:20:41.741
Last night?

00:20:42.242 --> 00:20:46.705
The fool took my Destruction to the stomach.

00:20:47.122 --> 00:20:49.082
All to protect one kid.

00:20:51.084 --> 00:20:52.585
You idiot!

00:20:52.585 --> 00:20:54.170
Why would you do that?

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:57.716
I couldn't just leave him.

00:20:59.676 --> 00:21:04.639
I couldn't abandon a man
with a promising future.

00:21:05.765 --> 00:21:08.643
Just like you couldn't abandon me.

00:21:12.522 --> 00:21:13.815
It will be...

00:21:14.816 --> 00:21:15.900
...his turn next.

00:21:22.532 --> 00:21:23.867
Tokugawa!

00:21:23.867 --> 00:21:25.160
Call the first aid team!

00:21:25.744 --> 00:21:28.246
He is indeed strong,

00:21:28.705 --> 00:21:30.331
but he is too kind.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:33.084
That's why I tested him.

00:21:33.877 --> 00:21:37.005
This is what happens when
you sacrifice yourself!

00:21:38.256 --> 00:21:39.424
Bastard!

00:21:41.343 --> 00:21:42.344
You're...

00:21:44.471 --> 00:21:46.014
...the worst!

00:23:18.398 --> 00:23:20.191
"Next Time"

00:23:20.191 --> 00:23:22.235
"Next Time"
Disgraceful, Tokugawa.

00:23:22.235 --> 00:23:25.780
Your strength is not enough
to fight on a global level.

00:23:26.156 --> 00:23:27.574
It's over.

00:23:27.574 --> 00:23:32.412
I've fought up until now
for this day, for this match.

00:23:32.829 --> 00:23:34.831
My resolve is greater than this.

